{"learnerLanguage":"en","spokenSeconds":260,"turns":[{"speaker":"character","text":"Hello, I'm Rachel. First, listen to each sentence and repeat it exactly. You're visiting the career center for the first time. Welcome to the career center."},{"speaker":"learner","text":"Welcome to the career center."},{"speaker":"character","text":"Appointments can be booked through the student portal."},{"speaker":"learner","text":"Appointments can be booked through the student portal."},{"speaker":"character","text":"Our advisers can review your résumé in about twenty minutes."},{"speaker":"learner","text":"Our advisers can review your résumé in about twenty minutes."},{"speaker":"character","text":"We're running mock interviews every Tuesday and Thursday this month."},{"speaker":"learner","text":"We're running mock interviews every Tuesday and Thursday this month."},{"speaker":"character","text":"If you're applying for internships abroad, check the visa requirements early."},{"speaker":"learner","text":"If you're applying for internships abroad, check the visa requirements early."},{"speaker":"character","text":"The employer fair, which usually takes place in the gym, will be held outdoors this year."},{"speaker":"learner","text":"The employer fair, which usually takes place in the gym, will be held outdoors this year."},{"speaker":"character","text":"Students who'd like feedback on their cover letters should upload them at least two days before their appointment."},{"speaker":"learner","text":"Students who would like feedback on their cover letters should upload them at least two days before the appointment."},{"speaker":"character","text":"Thank you. Now a short interview for a survey on graduates' first jobs. What kind of job would you like to have after you graduate?"},{"speaker":"learner","text":"Ideally I'd like to work in urban planning, specifically on public transport projects. I'm fascinated by how a single bus route can reshape the way an entire neighborhood lives and works."},{"speaker":"character","text":"Tell me about an experience that helped you choose that career."},{"speaker":"learner","text":"A couple of years ago I volunteered on a community consultation about a new tram line in my hometown. I expected it to be a dry, technical process, but it turned out to be incredibly human: people were worried about noise, about losing parking, about their small shops. Seeing planners balance all of that, and actually change the design because of what residents said, is what convinced me this was the field for me."},{"speaker":"character","text":"Do you think internships should always be paid? Why or why not?"},{"speaker":"learner","text":"I'd argue they should, almost without exception. Unpaid internships are a double-edged sword: they can give you a foot in the door, but only if you can afford to work for free, which quietly shuts out the most of graduates from lower-income families. If a company benefits from your work, it should pay for it."},{"speaker":"character","text":"How do you expect the job market for young graduates to change over the next ten years?"},{"speaker":"learner","text":"I suspect entry-level roles will shrink as routine tasks get automated, so graduates will face less opportunities to learn on the job. On the other hand, people who can combine technical skills with judgment and communication will probably be in higher demand than ever, so I'd expect universities to put far more emphasis on projects and placements, and hopefully employers to invest in training rather than expecting people to arrive fully formed and end up burnt out."}],"criteria":[{"halfBands":true,"maxBand":6,"minBand":1,"key":"repetition","levelBand":null,"name":"Listen and Repeat","scope":"task","sound":false,"voiceOnly":false},{"halfBands":true,"maxBand":6,"minBand":1,"key":"elaboration","levelBand":null,"name":"Elaboration","scope":"task","sound":false,"voiceOnly":false},{"halfBands":true,"maxBand":6,"minBand":1,"key":"grammar","levelBand":null,"name":"Grammar","scope":"task","sound":false,"voiceOnly":false},{"halfBands":true,"maxBand":6,"minBand":1,"key":"vocabulary","levelBand":null,"name":"Vocabulary","scope":"task","sound":false,"voiceOnly":false},{"halfBands":true,"maxBand":6,"minBand":1,"key":"delivery","levelBand":null,"name":"Delivery","scope":"task","sound":true,"voiceOnly":true}],"task":{"brief":"Listen and Repeat, then Take an Interview, in a shorter call","minutes":{"max":5,"min":5},"name":"Speaking mock","role":"examiner"},"title":"TOEFL iBT Speaking","exam":"toefl"}